{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"冯·诺依曼·life-and-times","stage":"DONE","category":"john-von-neumann","categoryLabel":"冯·诺依曼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.52,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.33,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/18_john-von-neumann/1_life-and-times","introMarkdown":"# 生平与时代\n\n冯·诺依曼一九〇三年十二月二十八日生于布达佩斯一个富裕的犹太银行家家庭，一九五七年二月八日因癌症病逝于华盛顿郊外的沃尔特·里德陆军医院，享年五十三岁。在这五十三年里，他先后在数学基础、量子力学、博弈论、计算机体系结构、核武器设计与冷战核战略上留下了奠基性的印记。\n\n这一卷不展开他具体的学术贡献本身——集合论公理化、最小最大定理、存储程序原理、元胞自动机这些技术内核，留给「核心贡献」「思想与方法」「代表作」几卷去讲。本卷只回答一个问题：这个人是怎样一步步走过来的。从布达佩斯路德会中学的少年，到布达佩斯大学的数学博士与苏黎世联邦理工的化工文凭，到哥廷根希尔伯特门下的博士后，再到一九三〇年赴美、一九三三年成为新成立的普林斯顿高等研究院最年轻的终身教授之一。\n\n战争把这位纯粹数学家推向应用前沿：他在曼哈顿计划中钻研内爆透镜的爆轰流体力学，战后又主持高等研究院的 IAS 计算机、推动氢弹研制、为兰德公司出谋划策、一九五五年出任原子能委员会委员。本卷分三章，按时间顺序铺陈：匈牙利少年的天赋与求学、远赴美国的学术黄金期、以及战争与英年早逝的最后岁月。每一章都尽量落到确切的年份、地名与人名，而非空泛的赞颂。\n\n读完本卷，你会看到一个在两个时代、两块大陆之间穿行的人——既是黑板前推演公理的纯数学家，也是核试验场边计算冲击波的国家智囊。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-hungarian-prodigy","title":"匈牙利神童","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/life-and-times/a-hungarian-prodigy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-child-prodigy","title":"神童","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/life-and-times/a-hungarian-prodigy/the-child-prodigy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"european-education","title":"欧洲的教育","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/life-and-times/a-hungarian-prodigy/european-education"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"to-america","title":"远赴美国","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/life-and-times/to-america","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"princeton-and-the-institute","title":"普林斯顿与高等研究院","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/life-and-times/to-america/princeton-and-the-institute"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-towering-figure","title":"一位巨擘","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/life-and-times/to-america/a-towering-figure"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"war-and-final-years","title":"战争与晚年","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/life-and-times/war-and-final-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-manhattan-project","title":"曼哈顿计划","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/life-and-times/war-and-final-years/the-manhattan-project"},{"seq":2,"slug":"later-years-and-death","title":"晚年与离世","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/life-and-times/war-and-final-years/later-years-and-death"}]}]}